From google/pkcs11test (https://github.com/google/pkcs11test), Apache-2.0,
at the revision pinned in run.sh. The default key of pkcs11test's SecretKey
helper becomes AES-256 instead of 3DES, the one secret-key type this token
generates, so the latch and Tookan tests built on it run against real keys;
callers that name a mechanism are unchanged. The context lines below are
upstream's. See README.md.

